56 692.20 moveto (Abstract. We give an explicit doubled simple cubic graph for which exhaustive pure YY-Delta) show
56 678.90 moveto (reduction attains a chain-free graph that is not minimal under the two degree-preserving moves.) show
56 665.60 moveto (The input has 18 vertices. Its labelled pure reduction DAG has 2328 states and 9846 legal-move) show
56 652.30 moveto (arcs; its smallest order is 11, attained by 25 labelled matrices. A selected minimum admits the) show
56 639.00 moveto (7-move sequence below to order 10. Thus Conjecture 5.1 of Jeffries and Yeats [1] is false under) show
56 625.70 moveto (the illustrated, edge-distinct reading of its chain definition. This qualification is part of the) show
56 612.40 moveto (statement, not a claim that the verbal definition is unambiguous in isolation.) show
/Times-Roman findfont 10.7 scalefont setfont
56 592.60 moveto (The Lean endpoint is Round2.literal_negation : not Literal.Conjecture51. We reuse the previously) show
56 579.30 moveto (replayed packet byte-identically; this manuscript task does not run Lean. The finite result has) show
56 566.00 moveto (modest significance: it disproves the proposed criterion for doubled cubic inputs, without) show
56 552.70 moveto (providing a replacement criterion or a new general simplification theory. No priority claim is) show
56 539.40 moveto (made. This draft and its computation scripts were prepared with OpenAI Codex assistance and) show
