56 705.50 moveto (In H the only possible end bases are 3, 6. Each has single neighbours 1 and 8; their mutual) show
56 692.20 moveto (connection has size three. The first triangle of a chain starting at either end must therefore use) show
56 678.90 moveto (that end together with 1 and 8. This conclusion uses the actual end row [1,1,2,2] and both) show
