56 592.60 moveto (triple connection between 1 and 8. All other available connections at that base are single.) show
/Times-Roman findfont 10.7 scalefont setfont
56 572.80 moveto (If the initial end was 6, the remaining candidates for the next triangle are 3 and 4. There is no) show
56 559.50 moveto (edge between 3 and 4, so no second triangle fits. If the initial end was 3, the candidates are 4) show
56 546.20 moveto (and 6, joined by a double connection. Either orientation of this second triangle fails to) show
56 532.90 moveto (continue: choosing 4 as the next base leaves no available double attachment at 4. Choosing 6 also) show
56 519.60 moveto (leaves no available double attachment there, because its double connection to 3 was already) show
56 506.30 moveto (consumed as an attachment at the starting end. Termination at 6 would require that same consumed) show
56 493.00 moveto (connection, so it fails as well. Vertex 4 cannot terminate because it is not an end base.) show
